# Instances of the WebSemantic core vocabulary for tunnel-load-simulator (generated 2026-10-23; documentation only).

:software a wsem:Software, schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
    schema:name "Tunnel Load Simulator: synthetic electricity demand of road tunnels (Python, Streamlit)" ;
    schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/cyrilvoyant/tunnel-load-simulator> ;
    wsem:conceptDOI "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20080042" ;
    schema:identifier <https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20080042> ;
    schema:license "MIT" ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Python" ;
    schema:description "Generates the electricity demand of a road tunnel from its geometry, traffic, lighting and ventilation, with random pollution episodes and accidents, over Monte Carlo realizations." ;
    schema:author [ a schema:Person ; schema:name "Haytham El-Houari" ] ;
    schema:author <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0242-7377> ;
    schema:citation <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.softx.2026.102946> ;
